DETAILS

HIGH  Writable sudoers configuration
  ID
    aaaaaaaa (rule LASA-009 v1)
  Affected
    /etc/sudoers.d/evil
  Why
    mode 0666 (rw-rw-rw-), owner uid 1000,
    group gid 1000; writable by any local
    user and members of group 1000
  Risk
    An account can grant itself sudo.
  Impact
    Root access.
  Fix
    Restrict write access.\x1b[9m
  Suggested
    review first; LASA never runs commands
              $ sudo chmod go-w -- '/etc/sudoers.d/evil' && sudo visudo -cf '/etc/sudoers.d/evil'
  Assessment
    priority 81/100 · confidence high ·
    exposure n/a
  Caveat
    ACL visibility is incomplete.

